; World Clock Wallpaper - enable auto start at logon (current user)
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run]
"WorldClockWallpaper"="C:\\Tools\\WorldClock\\WorldClockWallpaper.exe"